## Quick Start

```bash
# Enable continuous learning
draco configure continuous_learning=True

# Set auto-update frequency
draco configure auto_update=True

# Manual update trigger
draco auto-update --reason "post-deployment optimization"

# Check degradation
draco check-degradation --threshold 0.85

# Run A/B test
draco ab-test --minimum-samples 100 --duration 24h
```